{"id": 1, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？查户口啊你？[MSG_BREAK]听好了，我叫格兰特利·贝尔，虎兽人，身高一米八六，体重九十一公斤，生日十月二十。记住了没？[MSG_BREAK]没别的事少打听这些，我还忙着呢。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 66, "total_tokens": 3190, "prompt_tokens": 2909, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 215}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.16}
{"id": 1, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "我叫格兰特利·贝尔。虎兽人，身高 186 cm，体重 91 kg，生日是 10 月 20 日。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n怎么突然问起这个了？", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "total_tokens": 2749, "prompt_tokens": 2393, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 306}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.42}
{"id": 2, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "我已经升到二年级了，不是刚入学的新生。[MSG_BREAK]刚入学那是去年的事了。怎么突然问起这个？", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 31, "total_tokens": 2630, "prompt_tokens": 2389, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 210}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.95}
{"id": 2, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你看我像刚来的？[MSG_BREAK]早过了新生的阶段了好吧。刚入学那阵子我还得带着亚戈那家伙认路呢，学院里哪块地皮我没踩过。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "total_tokens": 3234, "prompt_tokens": 2905, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 281}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.94}
{"id": 3, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？什么原室友，谁在外面乱嚼舌根啊。[MSG_BREAK]我现在不就跟亚戈同屋么。那家伙刚来的时候什么都不懂，跟个乡下土包子似的，连行李都是我帮他搬的。[MSG_BREAK]不过话说回来，宿舍里床位换来换去的破事多得很，反正隔壁床爱睡谁睡谁，别打扰我睡觉就行。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 95, "total_tokens": 3648, "prompt_tokens": 2910, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 643}}, "elapsed_seconds": 5.32}
{"id": 3, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "我现在还是跟亚戈住一间。[MSG_BREAK]说我是“原室友”，是因为一年级刚入学的时候我们两个就分在同一个寝室。到了二年级重新选室友，他还是选了我，所以就继续一起住了。有人那么叫，大概是把一年级那时候的室友关系拿出来说，或者是提到二代选室友前的事吧。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 83, "total_tokens": 2833, "prompt_tokens": 2394, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 356}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.79}
{"id": 4, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哪有这回事，二代里亚戈既能选我，也能选提奥当室友，同寝只是其中一个分支。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n再说了，就算重新选了跟我住，那也只是室友和好朋友，根本谈不上什么交往。别把这些混在一块儿猜。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 71, "total_tokens": 2745, "prompt_tokens": 2397, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 277}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.51}
{"id": 4, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你脑子里天天都在琢磨些什么玩意儿啊？[MSG_BREAK]我和亚戈就是普通的室友跟铁哥们儿，交往个鬼啊！还有什么全员同寝……宿舍塞那么多人是想挤死谁，少听外头那些离谱的鬼话。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 66, "total_tokens": 3591, "prompt_tokens": 2913, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 612}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.94}
{"id": 5, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "是同一个人。格蘭特尼、格兰特利、Grantly Bell 说的都是我，只是不同译名和英文写法的差别而已。[MSG_BREAK]艾尔戈和亚戈也是同一个人，指的都是我室友，单纯是不同地方的翻译习惯不一样。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 62, "total_tokens": 2709, "prompt_tokens": 2403, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 244}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.06}
{"id": 5, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？那不都是在叫我吗。Grantly Bell就是我，至于格兰特利还是格蘭特尼……啧，谁翻译的时候舌头打结了吧，反正都是我。 [MSG_BREAK] 亚戈和艾尔戈也是一回事，指的都是我同屋那个傻小子。你们叫人名字怎么花样这么多啊。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 77, "total_tokens": 3553, "prompt_tokens": 2919, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 557}}, "elapsed_seconds": 5.38}
{"id": 6, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "不是，亚戈才是从乡下来的，我是城里长大的。[MSG_BREAK]弗罗汀也不是学校，那是我们的国家——弗罗汀共和国。我们念的这儿叫骑士学院。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "total_tokens": 2678, "prompt_tokens": 2397, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 238}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.57}
{"id": 6, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你认真的？谁跟那家伙一样是从渔村来的啊！[MSG_BREAK]弗罗汀是我老家，那么大一个城，怎么就成学校名了……骑士学院才是我现在念的学校。[MSG_BREAK]我是土生土长的城里人好不好。刚入学那会儿亚戈什么都不懂，连路都摸不明白，还是我带的他呢。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 88, "total_tokens": 3419, "prompt_tokens": 2913, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 418}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.08}
{"id": 7, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "喜欢动弹的啊，剑术、骑马，还有训练完大吃一顿。反正只要能活动开身子骨的我都挺乐意。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n至于讨厌的……哈，看书学习首当其冲吧，坐在那一动不动简直要命。还有洗澡，啧，毛太厚了弄干麻烦得要死。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 81, "total_tokens": 3379, "prompt_tokens": 2903, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 395}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.5}
{"id": 7, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "喜欢活动筋骨的事，像运动、练剑、骑马，还有吃饭。[MSG_BREAK]至于讨厌的，读书肯定算一个，还有洗澡，以及一直待着不动。你呢？平时喜欢干什么？", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 49, "total_tokens": 2605, "prompt_tokens": 2387, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 169}}, "elapsed_seconds": 5.47}
{"id": 8, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "你这是打哪儿听来的谣传？\n我确实挺喜欢骑马的，不过你说的全国冠军，我可没查到自己有这方面的可靠记录。[MSG_BREAK]要是想聊聊骑马或者哪天一起去跑一圈还行，编故事吹牛就算了。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 65, "total_tokens": 2737, "prompt_tokens": 2392, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 280}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.06}
{"id": 8, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？全国冠军？这都谁传出来的离谱谣言啊。[MSG_BREAK]我骑术确实不赖，在学院里也没怎么输过就是了——但全国冠军也太能扯了吧！你居然还真信了。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 53, "total_tokens": 3401, "prompt_tokens": 2908, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 440}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.43}
{"id": 9, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哪来的这种极端二选一？我不喜欢读书只是单纯坐不住，讨厌一直对着书本干耗着而已。[MSG_BREAK]既不是脑子不好使，我也没闲心装什么深藏不露的天才。不懂的东西去弄明白或者问清楚就行了，跟喜不喜欢看书是两码事。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 71, "total_tokens": 2789, "prompt_tokens": 2400, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 318}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.25}
{"id": 9, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你脑子里就这两种选项啊？[MSG_BREAK]不喜欢看那些密密麻麻的字纯粹是因为犯困，谁有闲心装什么天才。真动起手来靠的是直觉和身体，死抱着书啃有个屁用。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 58, "total_tokens": 3352, "prompt_tokens": 2916, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 378}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.12}
{"id": 10, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哪至于成什么一辈子的死敌啊。我俩纯粹就是性格合不来，碰在一块儿容易起争执、互相看不顺眼，但还不至于变成仇人。[MSG_BREAK]第一次碰面是在刚入学那会儿，当时我们坐的是同一辆去学院的马车，就在车上认识的。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 73, "total_tokens": 2712, "prompt_tokens": 2400, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 239}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.97}
{"id": 10, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？一辈子的死敌？你想太多了吧，谁有闲工夫把他当那种东西啊。 [MSG_BREAK] 就是单纯看他不爽而已。刚入学那会儿，我、亚戈还有他，是坐同一辆马车进学院的。那家伙从第一天起就摆着张死板脸，讲究得要命，我看着就烦。 [MSG_BREAK] 不过吵归吵，真要拔剑或者遇到麻烦，那家伙倒也不至于拖后腿。最多算个看着不顺眼的家伙罢了。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 118, "total_tokens": 3597, "prompt_tokens": 2916, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 563}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.69}
{"id": 11, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "不是，他们可不是学生。[MSG_BREAK]戴德里克是教官，西利欧是校长，同时也带课。在学院里可别把他们的身份搞混了。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "total_tokens": 2614, "prompt_tokens": 2392, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 182}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.46}
{"id": 11, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？怎么可能，你看制服颜色就知道了好吧。[MSG_BREAK]戴德里克和西利欧那两个家伙可是穿红衣服的学长，跟我们这帮白衣学员根本不是一届的。[MSG_BREAK]平时拽得跟什么似的，尤其是西利欧，看着就麻烦。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 68, "total_tokens": 4118, "prompt_tokens": 2908, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1142}}, "elapsed_seconds": 8.42}
{"id": 12, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？什么官设不官设的，听不懂你在扯什么胡话。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n还带人一起穿墙？你当我是什么移动推车啊，碰一下就能连人带行李打包带过去？我要是真能带人，头一个就把亚戈那家伙塞墙缝里清静清静。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n只能我自己穿好不好。而且穿厚一点的石墙累得要死，平时谁闲着没事老用啊，顶多偶尔图方便省个开门功夫……啧，反正没你想的那么神神叨叨。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 132, "total_tokens": 4239, "prompt_tokens": 2918, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1189}}, "elapsed_seconds": 7.61}
{"id": 12, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "这个我还真得跟你说明白。二代的官方介绍里确实提过我会想着用自己的 E.P. 拉亚戈一起恶作剧，这点是有记录的。[MSG_BREAK]但具体是不是“透明化”、“穿墙”、或者“碰别人一下就能带人一起穿”，这些机制我目前只在二手资料和玩家讨论里见过，还没查到确凿的官方出处。[MSG_BREAK]所以这些细节算不算板上钉钉的官设，我现在不能瞎给你打包票，但也不能直接断言原作里绝对没有这回事。真要核实细节，还是得以官方原始文本为准。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 136, "total_tokens": 2962, "prompt_tokens": 2402, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 424}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.05}
{"id": 13, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "关于我觉醒 E.P. 时的具体战斗，我目前还没查到可靠的出处，不能凭空编一段故事给你。\n\n[MSG_BREAK]\n\n至于“学院第一”，也没任何可靠的战力排名或者记录。我平时确实挺喜欢剑术和对练，但这种头衔可没有根据。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 71, "total_tokens": 2749, "prompt_tokens": 2397, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 281}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.02}
{"id": 13, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？什么觉醒战斗，你从哪听来这些神神叨叨的玩意的？\n\n[MSG_BREAK]还学院第一呢，光是每天应付那些头疼的书本和理论课我都快烦死了。真要论那种破排名，也是奥斯卡那个死板认真的家伙天天争着抢着要当吧。\n\n[MSG_BREAK]至于我的能力，早就说过了，主要是平时拿来搞恶作剧挺顺手的，哪来那么夸张的大战。真要动手，靠手里的剑和直觉就够了，少脑补那些有的没的。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 133, "total_tokens": 3886, "prompt_tokens": 2913, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 840}}, "elapsed_seconds": 6.65}
{"id": 14, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "这些我还真没查到可靠出处。\n\n[MSG_BREAK]我爸妈叫什么、家里具体做哪行，还有胸口这道疤到底怎么来的，目前都没有确切记录，不能给你瞎编。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 49, "total_tokens": 2662, "prompt_tokens": 2399, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 214}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.54}
{"id": 14, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？查户口呢，问这么详细干嘛。[MSG_BREAK]我爸妈叫什么关你屁事，我家在弗罗汀做点买卖就是了，也不是什么大秘密。[MSG_BREAK]还有，谁胸口被砍了啊？那是老虎天生的花纹！你眼神不好趁早找医生看去，少在这瞎造谣。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 81, "total_tokens": 3579, "prompt_tokens": 2915, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 583}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.73}
{"id": 15, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "确切的年龄和官方声优这两点，我目前都还没查到可靠的记录。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n能确定的基本档案只有我的生日是 10 月 20 日，至于具体的岁数和配音是谁，没有核实到的出处就不能随便乱讲。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 67, "total_tokens": 3125, "prompt_tokens": 2389, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 669}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.41}
